This is the intentional adapter delta applied to the vendored
`src/vendor/mnemopi/mcp-tools.ts`:

```diff
@@ tool schemas and dispatch @@
+Require an explicit non-empty `bank` on adapter calls.
+Expose only mnemopi_remember, mnemopi_recall, mnemopi_get,
+mnemopi_update, mnemopi_invalidate, and mnemopi_stats.
+Require bank in remember/recall/get/update/invalidate schemas.

@@ database and session selection @@
+Use MNEMOPI_BASE_DB_PATH for the configured base bank.
+Use session_id == channel_id == bank so native OMP rows are visible.
+Construct BeamMemory with config.workingMemoryLimit = 0.

@@ durable remember @@
-Default scope: session.
+Default scope: bank.
+Set trustTier: IMPORTED.
+Return exact persisted content in the result.

@@ error semantics @@
+Return structured memory_not_found errors for get/update/invalidate misses.
```

The full vendored file is the authoritative implementation; this note keeps
the provenance and behavioral boundary reviewable without requiring the OMP
